---
import { heroStats, person } from "../data/site";
---

<section id="top" class="relative scroll-mt-24 pb-16 pt-4 md:pb-20 lg:pt-2">
  <h1
    class="hero-title reveal text-[clamp(2.5rem,7.4vw,5.4rem)]"
    style="--reveal-delay:40ms"
  >
    I build things,
    <span class="ghost">then try to break them.</span>
  </h1>

  <p
    class="reveal mt-8 max-w-xl text-[1.0625rem] leading-relaxed text-dim md:text-lg"
    style="--reveal-delay:120ms"
  >
    Controllers, internal platforms and pipelines, mostly written in Go. An
    operator that keeps a workload matching its spec, a portal that turns a form
    into a running service, an admission gate that refuses an image built by the
    wrong workflow, a vision pipeline that names the birds at a drinking trough.
    Everything here runs, and every number is measured.
  </p>

  <dl
    class="reveal mt-12 grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-6 gap-y-8 sm:grid-cols-4"
    style="--reveal-delay:180ms"
  >
    {
      heroStats.map((stat) => (
        <div>
          <dt class="font-hero text-[clamp(1.9rem,4vw,2.9rem)] font-bold leading-none tracking-[-0.03em]">
            {stat.value}
          </dt>
          <dd class="mt-2.5 font-mono text-[0.6875rem] uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.08em] text-mute">
            {stat.label}
          </dd>
        </div>
      ))
    }
  </dl>

  <div
    class="reveal mt-12 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2"
    style="--reveal-delay:240ms"
  >
    <a
      href="#work"
      class="group flex min-h-40 flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl bg-accent p-5 text-accent-ink transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5"
    >
      <svg
        class="h-6 w-6"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        fill="none"
        stroke="currentColor"
        stroke-width="1.7"
        stroke-linecap="round"
        stroke-linejoin="round"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
        <path d="m12 3 9 5-9 5-9-5ZM3 12.5l9 5 9-5M3 16.5l9 5 9-5"></path>
      </svg>
      <span class="flex items-end justify-between gap-4">
        <span class="font-hero text-lg font-bold uppercase leading-tight tracking-[-0.01em]">
          Go, Kubernetes,<br />and what runs on it
        </span>
        <svg
          class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="1.9"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path>
        </svg>
      </span>
    </a>

    <a
      href={person.github}
      rel="me noopener"
      class="group flex min-h-40 flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl bg-ink p-5 text-bg transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5"
    >
      <svg
        class="h-6 w-6"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        fill="none"
        stroke="currentColor"
        stroke-width="1.7"
        stroke-linecap="round"
        stroke-linejoin="round"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
        <path d="m8 7-5 5 5 5M16 7l5 5-5 5M14 4l-4 16"></path>
      </svg>
      <span class="flex items-end justify-between gap-4">
        <span class="font-hero text-lg font-bold uppercase leading-tight tracking-[-0.01em]">
          Read the code,<br />it is all public
        </span>
        <svg
          class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:-translate-y-1 group-hover:translate-x-1"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="1.9"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <path d="M7 17 17 7M9 7h8v8"></path>
        </svg>
      </span>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
